Applies to the nixpkgs libretro.mgba source with 'patch -p1'. Adds a cycle-weighted PC histogram per memory region (retro_prof_*), used by the triage classifier and the FVMV / Sonic X 2 profilers.

--- a/src/arm/arm.c	1969-12-31 16:00:01.000000000 -0800
+++ b/src/arm/arm.c	2026-11-06 21:07:21.681121087 -0800
